        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*** Next open viewing scheduled for Saturday, 19th Sept from 9:30am 10:00am. No registration required. ***\n\nGet Property Estate Agents are delighted to bring 17 Derrynane Square to the open market.\n\n17 Derrynane Square is a two bedroom, one bathroom apartment totalling 60.2 sq. m. It is located on the second floor and at the rear of the main block, so west facing with minimum noise pollution. Derrynane Square was built in 1998 by Cosgrave, builders with a reputation for excellence.\n\nThe apartment has an intelligent layout and feels larger than its 60 sq. m. The living room is a wonderful room with a spacious layout and both bedrooms are comfortably doubles.\n\nThe accommodation features an entrance hall with access to a convenient hot-press for extra storage, a bathroom, two generously sized double bedrooms and an open-plan kitchen/dining/living area.\n\nAccommodation:\n\nKitchen:2.91 x 1.78 Tiled floor.\nLiving room/ Dining room: 6.94m x 3.31m Carpet flooring.\nBedroom 1: 2.54m x 3.78m Carpet flooring, built-in wardrobe.\nBedroom 2: 2.47m x 3.39m Carpet flooring, built-in wardrobe.\nBathroom: 2.06 x 1.62 Tiled floor, bath WHB & WC.\nHallway: 4.53 x 0.98 Carpet flooring\n\nDerrynane Square is just 1.8km to O`Connell Bridge. It is on the doorstep of great restaurants, cafes and bars. Excellent public transport links, including Q.B.C. and a 10 minute walk to the Luas line, make commuting a breeze. A regular bus service to Dublin Airport is also available. Great access to all four Dublin universities and within walking distance of three teaching hospitals (Rotunda, Mater, CHI Temple Street). \n\nThis apartment is located in a well-established and well-managed central development. Viewing is highly recommended. To arrange a viewing or to request further information, please contact Diana Farkas of Get Property Estate Agents by clicking the enquiry link or by calling 086 032 8362. \n\nPlease note: All measurements are approximate and are provided for guidance purposes only. \n\nPSRA Licence No. 002324.\n"
      },
